# Code owners for Argo Cloud OSINT Platform
#
# Each line is a file-pattern followed by one or more owners. Owners are
# automatically requested for review when a PR touches matching files.
# Owners must have write access to the repository.
#
# The single-maintainer configuration currently routes every path to
# @gnudrus-del. When the project gains additional maintainers, split
# by area (connectors, docs, security, frontend, packaging).

*                       @gnudrus-del

# Core platform
/osint_bot/             @gnudrus-del

# Connectors
/osint_bot/connectors/  @gnudrus-del

# Web UI (Python-served)
/osint_bot/web_static/  @gnudrus-del

# Next.js frontend
/web-next/              @gnudrus-del

# Documentation
/docs/                  @gnudrus-del
/README.md              @gnudrus-del
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @gnudrus-del
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @gnudrus-del
/SECURITY.md            @gnudrus-del
/CHANGELOG.md           @gnudrus-del

# CI + packaging
/.github/               @gnudrus-del
/pyproject.toml         @gnudrus-del
/Dockerfile             @gnudrus-del
/docker-compose.yml     @gnudrus-del
